                                                "sense_id": "76b702c7-1db1-33c5-a16f-7a7a8b9a2b2c",
                                                "text": "Three of the crack-related homicides were attributed to the psychopharmacological consequences of ingesting crack (increased violence, excitability, and irrationality), and eight homicides were attributed to the economic compulsion to engage in crime in order to subsidize drug use."
